  m_Name: Note03_Candidates
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ItemData
  itemName: Subject 003 - Candidates
  itemDescription: The unwilling volunteers
  fullNoteContent: "Below is a list of candidates for consideration in our experimentation,
    specifically for subject 003, compiled by Dr. Jess Rogers and Dr. Tony Glenn:\n\n1.
    Carter Moors - Janitor: Working in S4, digging into his life outside Pangea shows
    no wife or kids, contact with other family members unknown.\n\n(Handwritten)
    Notes: No, he is quite well known among the staff of S4 and I\u2019m sure some
    of them won\u2019t take too kindly to their own friend being taken for experimentation,
    and besides if we can\u2019t confirm that no one on the outside will come and
    ask questions then it\u2019s too big of a risk to take.\n\n2. Danny Victor -
    Construction: As with Mr. Moors, no wife or kids,and we can confirm that Mr.Victor
    has very little to essentially no contact with other family members.\n\n(Handwritten)
    Notes: No, construction is a small team compared to others in Pangea, and one
    that is unaware of the full extent of what we\u2019re doing, so they are bound
    to notice one of their own going missing and in turn sticking their nose where
    it doesn\u2019t belong.\n\n3. Howard Clark - S4 Security: Also working in S4,
    he has no friends both inside Pangea and out, investigations show no wife, kids
    or any other family.\n\n(Handwritten) Notes: He is our best bet yet, no one on
    the outside to ask questions and people inside are far less likely to care about
    one security officer, who spends all his time alone in the office, going missing
    rather than the janitor they see and talk to every day, we can tell them that
    he volunteered for this anyway, it\u2019s not like anyone knows him well enough
    to confirm that."
  type: 1
  icon: {fileID: 0}
